                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Trump Administration\u2019s \u201cBig Ugly Law\u201d threatens to slash food assistance programs, putting families at risk and leaving children without the nutrition they need to grow up healthy.\n\nThat\u2019s why I helped secure $1.3 million in federal USDA Reach & Resiliency funds to support FIND Food Bank\u2019s expansion. I was proud to join them last week to celebrate the opening of their new facility, which will strengthen the fight against hunger and ensure families have access to the food they need.",
