                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I joined Inland Empire Reps. Takano, Aguilar, and Torres at the Feeding America warehouse in Riverside to highlight how vital SNAP is for families in our communities.\n\nFeeding America Riverside and San Bernardino Counties provides essential nutrition support for thousands of families, many of whom reside in the communities I serve. As food costs rise, Congressional Republicans and the Trump administration are withholding critical SNAP funding due to the shutdown, I will continue to care for the people most impacted and fight to open the government, lower costs, and restore SNAP.",
